{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING: Do not play if you\u2019re scared by squares.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared by Squares is a horror puzzle game built entirely from cubes. Explore eerie rooms, solve logic and memory puzzles, and survive platforming challenges as you hunt down anomalies, shapes that don\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game runs in both standard and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.poster.avif?t=1765206076\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.webm?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.mp4?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room inside the Cube offers something new: puzzles that twist your mind, traps to dodge, and jump scares that strike when you least expect them. You\u2019ll need focus, timing, and a little courage to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.poster.avif?t=1765206076\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.webm?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.mp4?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been sent into a digital prison made of perfect squares after reports of corrupted geometry. Cleanse the Cube by finding every anomaly and restore balance before it consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.poster.avif?t=1765206076\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.webm?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.mp4?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Evolving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing with multiplayer currently in the works and more floors, puzzles, and new types of anomalies will be added as the Cube continues to expand.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719480?t=1765206076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719480?t=1765206076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765206076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765206076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING: Do not play if you\u2019re scared by squares.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared by Squares is a horror puzzle game built entirely from cubes. Explore eerie rooms, solve logic and memory puzzles, and survive platforming challenges as you hunt down anomalies, shapes that don\u2019t belong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game runs in both standard and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.poster.avif?t=1765206076\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.webm?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.mp4?t=1765206076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room inside the Cube offers something new: puzzles that twist your mind, traps to dodge, and jump scares that strike when you least expect them. You\u2019ll need focus, timing, and a little courage to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.poster.avif?t=1765206076\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"http